  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 2,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我把y₀从0调整到1。请注意，平移截面只是改变了我们选择研究的特定曲线，移动y₀本身绝不等于对x求导。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 1,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "当固定y等于1时，原曲面方程转化为一元函数g(x)等于x平方加1。若我们在截面上取x₀等于1，就确定了空间点P(1, 1, 2)。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "content": {
              "capability": "function_plot",
              "parameters": {
                "title": "截面内截线与切线关系（纵轴为高度z）",
                "x_label": "x",
                "y_label": "z",
                "curve_labels": [
                  "截线 z=x²+1",
                  "P处切线 z=2x"
                ],
                "expressions": [
                  "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                  "(2)*(x)"
                ]
              }
            },
            "role": "main_visual",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "new_region"
            },
            "reusable_item": 2
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "g(x) = x^2 + 1 \\quad (y_0 = 1)"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
